Chromium/Blink root scrollbar and viewport source notices
Revision: 6c1d401fcca5e1b0030563a90c2f2bba168e0c15

This integration reconnects the existing native viewport scroll owner,
overflow propagation, scrollbar-change relayout and CSSOM client geometry.
It does not relicense Rechrom or replace source-specific license terms.
The repository retains Chromium, LGPL-2 and LGPL-2.1 license texts.


